{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>נתן</b> Four times in the Masorah: here, and the other לחמו נתן מימיו נאמנים, בתוך חללים נתן, ביד מלך ישראל נתן. Pharaoh, who did not give straw — he sank in the sea, and not only that, but he descended to Gehenna, as it is written בתוך חללים נתן — among those who go down to the pit — as it is written שמה פרעה וכל המונו. But לחמו נתן — he who gives his bread to the poor, his waters are faithful, as it is written הלא פרוס לרעב לחמך וגו', and afterward it is written והיית כגן רוה וכמוצא מים אשר לא יכזבו מימיו."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:59.505300413Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}